  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#GapFinding">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" />
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Gap Finding</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="fr">Constat d'Ecart</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A detected gap or anomaly from organizational analysis. Types:
  - Structural blank: L3 carried by nobody in any unit
  - Coverage asymmetry: L3 federated with uneven domain coverage
  - Broken dependency: Input Supplier → Outcome Consumer chain disrupted
  - Duplicate/conflict: Multiple teams carrying same L3 without coordination
  - Operating model drift: observed ≠ target without explicit decision
  - Vacancy risk: key stakeholder role unfilled</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
