  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#OrganizationalSnapshot">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" />
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Organizational Snapshot</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="fr">Instantane Organisationnel</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A point-in-time capture of the complete organizational mapping.
Taken quarterly (recommended), enabling trend analysis:
  - Capability migrations between operating models
  - Maturity evolution per domain
  - Gap closure tracking
  - Drift detection (unintended changes)
