    <rdfs:label xml:lang="fr">Integration &amp; Ingestion des Donnees</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Establishes and manages data integration and ingestion across the enterprise through pipeline orchestration, real-time streaming, batch processing, change data capture, and external data acquisition. The connective tissue between data sources and consumption platforms.</skos:definition>
