  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_GOVERN_L2.2_L3.3_S06">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_GOVERN_L2.2_L3.3"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_06_DataEconomics"/>
    <dom:textContent>Data ownership is among the highest-ROI governance investments — domains with active, accountable data owners achieve 40-60% lower data quality defect rates and 30% faster analytical query resolution. The cost of ownership (estimated at 5-10% of a senior individual's time) is vastly outweighed by the reduction in downstream remediation, analytical rework, and regulatory exposure from data misuse.</dom:textContent>
  </rdf:Description>
