  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_GOVERN_L2.3_L3.3_S01">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_GOVERN_L2.3_L3.3"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_01_Definition"/>
    <dom:textContent>Manages the enterprise data technology portfolio through a structured Technology Radar classifying technologies by lifecycle stage (adopt, trial, assess, hold, retire) and provides reference architectures as prescriptive patterns for common data platform scenarios. Prevents premature technology adoption and uncontrolled proliferation while enabling deliberate innovation.</dom:textContent>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_GOVERN_L2.3_L3.3_S02">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_GOVERN_L2.3_L3.3"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_02_BusinessContext"/>
    <dom:textContent>Without technology lifecycle management, organisations accumulate dangerous technology debt — unsupported platforms, security-vulnerable legacy systems, and fragmented tool estates that resist integration. Premature adoption of unproven technology creates delivery risk on critical programmes. The Technology Radar provides the navigational instrument between premature adoption and competitive stagnation.</dom:textContent>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_GOVERN_L2.3_L3.3_S03_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Technology Radar — Structured classification of all relevant data technologies by adoption lifecycle stage with rationale and review cadence</dom:itemText>
    <dom:relatedDimension>Data</dom:relatedDimension>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_GOVERN_L2.3_L3.3_S03_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Reference Architecture Library — Prescriptive architecture patterns for common data scenarios including lakehouse, streaming, data product, and AI platform</dom:itemText>
    <dom:relatedDimension>Data</dom:relatedDimension>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_GOVERN_L2.3_L3.3_S03_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Technology Evaluation Process — Structured methodology for assessing new technologies before Radar classification change</dom:itemText>
    <dom:relatedDimension>Process</dom:relatedDimension>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_GOVERN_L2.3_L3.3_S03_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Technology Retirement Planning — Managed decommissioning of technologies reaching end-of-life, preventing stranded investment and security exposure</dom:itemText>
    <dom:relatedDimension>Process</dom:relatedDimension>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_GOVERN_L2.3_L3.3_S03_I5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Technology Community — Internal community of practice for data technology evaluation and knowledge sharing</dom:itemText>
    <dom:relatedDimension>People</dom:relatedDimension>
  </rdf:Description>
