       Specification: Data Dictionaries &amp; Catalogue Operations
       ============================================================ -->
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S01">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_01_Definition"/>
    <dom:sectionText>Data Dictionaries and Catalogue Operations is the capability to maintain comprehensive, attribute-level technical documentation of all data assets — specifying field names, data types, allowed values, business rules, and physical storage details — and to operate the enterprise data catalogue platform as a reliable, performant, and user-friendly service. It bridges technical metadata from physical implementations with the business context of the glossary, forming the practical reference layer used daily by data engineers, analysts, and stewards.</dom:sectionText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S02">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_02_BusinessContext"/>
    <dom:sectionText>Without maintained data dictionaries, data engineers write pipelines against undocumented schemas, silently propagating incorrect interpretations. Analysts write queries that return wrong results because field semantics are misunderstood — is 'order_date' the order creation date, the payment date, or the shipping date? In regulated industries, undocumented data definitions create accountability gaps that appear in audit findings as evidence of inadequate data governance controls. The practical cost is re-work: teams repeatedly solve the same interpretation problems because the answer is not documented.</dom:sectionText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S06">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_06_DataEconomics"/>
    <dom:sectionText>Catalogue operations and data dictionary maintenance require ongoing platform engineering (0.5-1 FTE), stewardship coordination (1-2 FTE), and helpdesk support. The economic case mirrors metadata management: reducing interpretation time for the data consumer population generates productivity returns that consistently exceed the investment. Organisations with 100+ active data consumers report catalogue adoption recovering 0.5-1 hour per consumer per week — at scale this represents significant productivity gains.</dom:sectionText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S03_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Attribute-level data dictionary — field-by-field documentation of all data assets including data type, allowed values, business definition, and source system rules</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S03_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Catalogue platform operations — reliable, high-availability operation of the enterprise catalogue including ingestion pipelines, search indexing, and API availability</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S03_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Stewardship workflow management — routing enrichment tasks to appropriate stewards, tracking completion, and escalating overdue items</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S03_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Data dictionary version management — tracking schema changes, documenting the business impact of field changes, and maintaining a history of attribute evolution</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S03_I5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Self-service catalogue adoption — user training, onboarding materials, and helpdesk support enabling all eligible data consumers to use the catalogue effectively</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S03">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_03_KeyAspects"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S03_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S03_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S03_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S03_I4"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S03_I5"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S04_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Zero-ambiguity data interpretation — every field in every governed asset has a documented, approved business definition accessible to all data consumers</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S04_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Reduced engineering re-work — engineers write correct pipelines the first time because field semantics are documented and accessible</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S04_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Audit-ready data documentation — attribute-level documentation satisfies auditor requests for data definition evidence without ad-hoc investigation</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S04_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Catalogue as enterprise data infrastructure — reliable catalogue availability treated with the same operational discipline as data platforms</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S04">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_04_StrategicObjectives"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S04_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S04_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S04_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S04_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S05_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>GOVERN — Ownership assigns the stewards responsible for maintaining data dictionaries; Architecture defines the dictionary schema standards</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S05_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>MANAGE — data dictionaries are the physical manifestation of logical models and standards; quality rules reference dictionary definitions; lineage surfaces in the catalogue</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S05_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>BUILD — all new data assets delivered with dictionary entries as a deployment requirement; catalogue API consumed by pipeline tools for schema validation</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S05_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>RUN — analysts use dictionaries as the primary reference for field selection and query design; data products published with catalogue entries</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S05">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_05_RelationshipToMacroProcesses"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S05_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S05_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S05_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S05_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S07_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>IN-SCOPE: Attribute-level data dictionaries for all governed data assets in the enterprise catalogue</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S07_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>IN-SCOPE: Catalogue platform operations including availability, performance, ingestion pipeline maintenance, and integration health</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S07_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>IN-SCOPE: Stewardship workflow operations and completion tracking</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S07_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>OUT-OF-SCOPE: Catalogue product feature development (managed as a Build initiative under platform development governance)</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S07_I5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>OUT-OF-SCOPE: Application-level code documentation (Engineering chapter responsibility)</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_MANAGE_L2.3_L3.6_S07">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
