  <!-- Specification: Feature Store &amp; Training Data Management -->
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S01">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_01_Definition"/>
    <dom:sectionText>Feature Store and Training Data Management is the capability to define, compute, store, version, and serve machine learning feature sets in a governed, reusable, and consistent manner across both offline training and online inference contexts. It ensures that features used in model training are identical to those computed at inference time, eliminating training-serving skew. It also manages the versioning, lineage, and access governance of training datasets enabling reproducible model development.</dom:sectionText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S02">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_02_BusinessContext"/>
    <dom:sectionText>ML features are the most high-value, expensive-to-produce data assets in a data-intensive organisation. Without a feature store, each data science team computes its own feature pipeline, leading to duplicate engineering effort, inconsistent feature definitions between teams, and training-serving skew — where features computed differently in training versus production cause models to perform worse. This skew is invisible without systematic feature management and is a leading cause of model performance degradation.</dom:sectionText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S06">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_06_DataEconomics"/>
    <dom:sectionText>Feature store investment is primarily platform tooling (Feast, Hopsworks, Databricks Feature Store, SageMaker Feature Store) and feature engineering labour. The economic case is strongest in organisations with multiple ML teams: each team rebuilding features from scratch costs 2-4 weeks of engineering effort per feature group. A shared feature store typically delivers 30-50% reduction in feature engineering time for new models.</dom:sectionText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S03_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Feature registry — governed catalogue of all defined features with business definition, computation logic, data type, owner, and versioning</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S03_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Offline feature computation — batch feature pipelines producing training datasets at scale with point-in-time correctness to prevent data leakage</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S03_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Online feature serving — low-latency feature retrieval at inference time from online store (Redis, DynamoDB) using identical computation logic as offline</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S03_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Training-serving consistency — single feature computation definition used for both training and inference; automatic validation of online/offline feature parity</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S03_I5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Feature versioning and lineage — version-controlled feature definitions with lineage from raw source data through to model training runs</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S03">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_03_KeyAspects"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S03_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S03_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S03_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S03_I4"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S03_I5"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S04_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Reusable feature engineering — features computed once and shared across multiple models, eliminating redundant engineering effort</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S04_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Elimination of training-serving skew — consistent features between training and inference environments improves model production performance</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S04_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Reproducible model development — point-in-time correct training datasets with versioned features enabling experiment reproducibility</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S04_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Model governance compliance — feature lineage and training data provenance available for model risk management and AI regulatory requirements</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S04">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_04_StrategicObjectives"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S04_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S04_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S04_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S04_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S05_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>GOVERN — AI Governance principles mandate feature lineage and training data provenance; data standards define feature naming and type conventions</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S05_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>MANAGE — features registered in data catalogue; training datasets governed with retention and access controls; DPIA required for features derived from personal data</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S05_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>BUILD — feature computation pipelines run on batch (L2.1.L3.3) and streaming (L2.1.L3.2) infrastructure; online feature store integrated with model serving infrastructure (L2.3.L3.2)</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S05_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>RUN — data scientists consume feature store for model development; online serving integrates with real-time inference endpoints</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S05">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_05_RelationshipToMacroProcesses"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S05_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S05_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S05_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S05_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S07_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>IN-SCOPE: All ML features consumed by production models or experimental model development</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S07_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>IN-SCOPE: Offline training dataset generation with point-in-time correctness</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S07_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>IN-SCOPE: Online feature serving for real-time inference use cases</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S07_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>OUT-OF-SCOPE: Model architecture, training algorithms, and hyperparameter optimisation (ML model development — BUILD L2.3.L3.2)</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S07_I5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>OUT-OF-SCOPE: Application-specific derived values that are not ML features (application logic)</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S07">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_07_ScopeBoundaries"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S07_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S07_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S07_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S07_I4"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S07_I5"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S08_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Raw data sources (data lake, warehouse, streaming) — foundation data consumed by feature engineering pipelines</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S08_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Data Science teams (RUN) — define feature requirements and validate feature correctness for their model domains</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S08_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Data Quality (MANAGE.L2.4.L3.2) — quality rules applied to feature pipelines to detect data issues before model training impact</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S08_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>ML Platform (BUILD L2.3.L3.2) — consumes feature store for model training runs and connects online store to inference endpoints</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S08">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_08_InputSuppliersProviders"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S08_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S08_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S08_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S08_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S09_SH1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#StakeholderItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Chief Data Officer / Head of ML Platform — accountable for feature store capability and feature reuse culture</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S09_SH2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#StakeholderItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>ML Platform Engineer / Feature Engineer — builds and maintains the feature store infrastructure and computation pipelines</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S09_SH3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#StakeholderItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Data Scientists (RUN) — register, consume, and co-own features within their domain expertise</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S09_SH4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#StakeholderItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>ML Risk and Governance (MANAGE) — requires feature lineage and training data documentation for model risk reviews</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S09_SH5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#StakeholderItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Data Engineers (BUILD L2.1) — implement batch feature computation pipelines feeding the offline store</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S09">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_09_Stakeholders"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S09_SH1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S09_SH2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S09_SH3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S09_SH4"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S09_SH5"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S10_A1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ActivityItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Operate the feature registry: manage feature definition submissions, versioning, deprecation, and cross-feature dependency documentation</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S10_A2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ActivityItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Build and maintain feature computation pipelines: implement batch and streaming feature computation ensuring point-in-time correctness</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S10_A3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ActivityItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Operate online feature store: manage online store infrastructure (Redis, DynamoDB) availability, latency, and cache currency</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S10_A4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ActivityItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Enforce training-serving consistency: validate that online store features match offline computation logic through automated parity testing</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S10_A5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ActivityItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Manage training dataset creation: produce versioned, point-in-time correct training datasets; maintain dataset registry</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S10_A6">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ActivityItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Support model governance: produce feature lineage documentation and training dataset provenance records for model risk reviews</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S10">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_10_Activities"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S10_A1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S10_A2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S10_A3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S10_A4"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S10_A5"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S10_A6"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S11_T1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ToolItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Databricks Feature Store, Feast, Hopsworks, AWS SageMaker Feature Store, Tecton — feature registry, offline store, and online serving</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S11_T2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ToolItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Redis, Amazon DynamoDB, Google Bigtable — low-latency feature retrieval at inference time (online store)</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S11_T3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ToolItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>dbt, Spark, Airflow — batch feature computation and training dataset generation pipelines</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S11_T4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ToolItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Evidently AI, Arize AI, WhyLabs — feature drift detection and training-serving skew monitoring</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S11">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_11_Tools"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S11_T1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S11_T2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S11_T3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S11_T4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S12_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Feature registry — all production features with computation logic, versioning, lineage, owner, and consumption statistics</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S12_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Training dataset catalogue — versioned training datasets with feature composition, creation date, row count, and model consumption history</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S12_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Online-offline parity report — automated validation results confirming online store features match offline computation definitions</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S12_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Feature lineage documentation — end-to-end provenance from raw source through feature computation to model training runs</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S12">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_12_PrimaryDeliverables"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S12_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S12_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S12_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S12_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S13_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Data science teams (RUN) — consume features for model development; contribute new features to shared registry</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S13_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Model serving infrastructure (BUILD L2.3.L3.2) — integrates online feature store for real-time inference</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S13_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Model registry (BUILD L2.3.L3.4) — receives training dataset version references as part of model artefact documentation</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S13_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Model Risk Management (MANAGE) — consumes feature lineage and training data provenance for model risk assessments</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S13">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_13_OutcomesConsumers"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S13_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S13_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S13_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S13_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S14_K1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#KPIItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Feature reuse rate — percentage of features in new production models sourced from the shared feature registry</dom:itemText>
    <dom:kpiTarget>>60%</dom:kpiTarget>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S14_K2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#KPIItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Online-offline feature parity — percentage of production online features with automated parity test passing versus offline computation</dom:itemText>
    <dom:kpiTarget>100%</dom:kpiTarget>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S14_K3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#KPIItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Training dataset reproducibility — percentage of historical training runs reproducible from registered feature versions and dataset snapshots</dom:itemText>
    <dom:kpiTarget>&gt;95%</dom:kpiTarget>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S14_K4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#KPIItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Online feature serving latency — P99 latency for feature retrieval at model inference time</dom:itemText>
    <dom:kpiTarget>&lt;10ms</dom:kpiTarget>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S14_K5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#KPIItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Feature freshness — percentage of online features refreshed within committed freshness window for real-time serving</dom:itemText>
    <dom:kpiTarget>>99%</dom:kpiTarget>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S14">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_14_KPIs"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S14_K1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S14_K2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S14_K3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S14_K4"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S14_K5"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S15_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Online-offline parity is the critical guarantee — the feature store's primary value is eliminating training-serving skew; if parity is not tested and enforced, the capability fails its primary purpose</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S15_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Point-in-time correct training data is non-negotiable — training datasets including future-state data produce models with inflated metrics that fail in production</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S15_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Feature registry culture requires data scientist buy-in — a feature store only delivers reuse value if scientists register and consume from the shared registry</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S15_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Lineage must connect to the model — feature lineage stopping at the feature store without connecting to the model training run cannot satisfy model governance requirements</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S15">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_15_SuccessFactors"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S15_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S15_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S15_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S15_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#CapabilitySpecification"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Specification: Feature Store &amp; Training Data Management</rdfs:label>
    <dom:specifiesCapability rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_FeatureStoreTrainingDataManagement"/>
    <dom:hasSectionContent rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S01"/>
    <dom:hasSectionContent rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S02"/>
    <dom:hasSectionContent rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S03"/>
    <dom:hasSectionContent rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S04"/>
    <dom:hasSectionContent rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S05"/>
    <dom:hasSectionContent rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S06"/>
    <dom:hasSectionContent rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S07"/>
    <dom:hasSectionContent rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S08"/>
    <dom:hasSectionContent rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S09"/>
    <dom:hasSectionContent rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S10"/>
    <dom:hasSectionContent rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S11"/>
    <dom:hasSectionContent rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S12"/>
    <dom:hasSectionContent rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S13"/>
    <dom:hasSectionContent rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S14"/>
    <dom:hasSectionContent rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.1_S15"/>
  </rdf:Description>

  <!-- Specification: ML Pipeline &amp; Model Infrastructure -->
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S01">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_01_Definition"/>
    <dom:sectionText>ML Pipeline and Model Infrastructure is the capability to provide the compute, tooling, and automation required for machine learning model development, training, evaluation, and deployment. It encompasses experiment tracking, distributed training infrastructure, hyperparameter optimisation, model evaluation frameworks, and the CI/CD pipelines that automate model promotion from development through testing to production serving. This capability ensures that ML models are developed with engineering rigour comparable to software engineering — reproducibility, version control, and automated quality gates.</dom:sectionText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S02">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_02_BusinessContext"/>
    <dom:sectionText>Without structured ML infrastructure, data science operates as an artisanal craft — models trained on individual laptops, results tracked in spreadsheets, deployment requiring manual hand-offs, and no systematic way to reproduce an experiment from 6 months ago. This creates a constant bottleneck between model development and production deployment, quality regressions discovered only after production impact, and knowledge that lives in individual heads rather than documented reproducible artefacts.</dom:sectionText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S06">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_06_DataEconomics"/>
    <dom:sectionText>ML infrastructure covers GPU cloud compute (highly variable), platform tooling (MLflow, Kubeflow, SageMaker, Vertex AI), and platform engineering effort. Efficient infrastructure management can reduce GPU costs 30-60% through spot instance use, right-sizing, and efficient distributed training. Teams with mature ML pipelines ship models to production 3-5x faster than teams with manual deployment processes.</dom:sectionText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S03_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Experiment tracking and management — systematic recording of hyperparameters, metrics, code versions, and data references for all training runs</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S03_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Distributed training infrastructure — GPU/TPU cluster management, distributed training framework support, and automatic resource provisioning for large-scale training</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S03_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Hyperparameter optimisation (HPO) — automated search over hyperparameter space using Bayesian optimisation, random search, or early stopping</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S03_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Model evaluation framework — standardised offline evaluation metrics, fairness and bias assessment, and performance regression detection before deployment</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S03_I5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>ML CI/CD automation — automated pipelines that train, evaluate, and deploy models when triggered by code, data, or schedule changes with quality gates</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S03">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_03_KeyAspects"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S03_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S03_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S03_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S03_I4"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S03_I5"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S04_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Reproducible ML development — any training run can be reproduced exactly from tracked artefacts, enabling debugging and regulatory review</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S04_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Faster model iteration — automated training, evaluation, and deployment pipelines reduce time-from-experiment-to-production from weeks to days</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S04_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Consistent model quality standards — automated evaluation gates prevent model regressions from reaching production</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S04_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Scalable training — distributed infrastructure enabling training on datasets and models that exceed single-machine capacity</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S04">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_04_StrategicObjectives"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S04_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S04_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S04_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S04_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S05_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>GOVERN — AI Governance defines model quality standards and evaluation requirements that ML CI/CD gates must enforce</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S05_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>MANAGE — training runs documented with feature store references and training data versions for model governance compliance</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S05_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>BUILD — ML pipeline infrastructure runs on cloud compute (L2.2); training data sourced from feature store (L2.3.L3.1); trained models registered in model registry (L2.3.L3.4)</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S05_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>RUN — data scientists use ML infrastructure for model development; trained models served through LLM/serving infrastructure (L2.3.L3.3) or direct APIs</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S05">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_05_RelationshipToMacroProcesses"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S05_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S05_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S05_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S05_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S07_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>IN-SCOPE: All infrastructure supporting ML model training, evaluation, and deployment automation</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S07_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>IN-SCOPE: Experiment tracking, distributed training, HPO, and ML CI/CD for all production and experimental ML workloads</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S07_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>IN-SCOPE: Model evaluation framework and quality gate enforcement before production deployment</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S07_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>OUT-OF-SCOPE: Model architecture research and algorithmic innovation (data science capability in RUN)</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.2_S07_I5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>OUT-OF-SCOPE: LLM serving and inference infrastructure (BUILD L2.3.L3.3)</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
