  <!-- Specification: Model Registry &amp; Versioning -->
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S01">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_01_Definition"/>
    <dom:sectionText>Model Registry and Versioning is the capability to maintain a governed, centralised repository of all ML model artefacts — including trained models, their associated metadata, evaluation results, training data references, and deployment history — providing the single source of truth for model lifecycle management. It enables promotion workflows that gate model deployment on quality approvals, maintains complete provenance from training data to production deployment, and supports model governance and compliance by providing auditable evidence of how each deployed model was developed, evaluated, and approved.</dom:sectionText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S02">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_02_BusinessContext"/>
    <dom:sectionText>Without a model registry, ML organisations lose track of which model version is in production, cannot reproduce the training run that produced a deployed model, and have no systematic way to compare model versions during evaluation. When a regulatory examiner asks which data was used to train the model that made a credit decision, the answer requires the model registry to exist and contain complete provenance. As AI regulation (EU AI Act) matures, model governance documentation is no longer optional — it is a compliance obligation.</dom:sectionText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S06">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_06_DataEconomics"/>
    <dom:sectionText>Model registry tooling (MLflow, W&amp;B, Comet ML, Vertex AI Model Registry) is a modest investment relative to its governance value. The primary cost is the discipline of consistent model documentation — incomplete metadata makes the registry unusable for governance. As AI regulatory requirements intensify (EU AI Act high-risk AI systems), the model registry becomes compliance infrastructure with mandatory rather than optional ROI.</dom:sectionText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S03_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Model artefact storage — versioned storage of model weights, preprocessing pipelines, feature schemas, and associated configuration</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S03_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Model metadata catalogue — structured documentation of each model version including training data reference, feature set version, evaluation metrics, and known limitations</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S03_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Promotion workflow — gated lifecycle stages (development, staging, production, archived) with role-based approvals required for each promotion</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S03_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Deployment history — complete record of which model version was deployed to each environment at each point in time</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S03_I5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Model comparison and lineage — side-by-side evaluation metric comparison across versions; lineage from raw data through features to training run to deployed model</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S03">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_03_KeyAspects"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S03_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S03_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S03_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S03_I4"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S03_I5"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S04_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Model governance compliance — complete, auditable model documentation satisfying AI governance, model risk management, and AI regulatory requirements</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S04_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Safe model deployment — promotion gates prevent unapproved or under-performing models from reaching production</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S04_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Reproducible ML — any historical model version can be reconstructed from registry-stored artefacts and references</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S04_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Rollback capability — rapid rollback to a previous model version when production performance degrades</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S04">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_04_StrategicObjectives"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S04_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S04_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S04_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S04_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S05_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>GOVERN — AI Governance defines model card requirements, approval workflows, and documentation standards that the registry operationalises</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S05_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>MANAGE — model registry is a governed data asset; model cards discoverable through the data catalogue; DPIA for models processing personal data referenced in registry</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S05_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>BUILD — ML pipeline (L2.3.L3.2) produces trained models logged to the registry; serving infrastructure (L2.3.L3.3) deploys from the registry</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S05_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>RUN — data scientists query the registry to understand production model versions, compare performance, and initiate retraining requests</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S05">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_05_RelationshipToMacroProcesses"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S05_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S05_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S05_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S05_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S07_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>IN-SCOPE: All ML models used in production decisions, analytics, and customer-facing applications</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S07_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>IN-SCOPE: Model artefact storage, metadata documentation, promotion workflows, and deployment history</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S07_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>IN-SCOPE: Model comparison, lineage documentation, and rollback capability</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S07_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>OUT-OF-SCOPE: Experimental models under development with no intention of production deployment</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S07_I5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>OUT-OF-SCOPE: Third-party API-based models (OpenAI, Anthropic APIs) where model artefacts are not owned — governed through AI usage policies</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S07">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_07_ScopeBoundaries"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S07_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S07_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S07_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S07_I4"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S07_I5"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S08_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>ML pipeline (BUILD L2.3.L3.2) — produces trained model artefacts and evaluation results logged to the registry</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S08_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Feature store (BUILD L2.3.L3.1) — provides feature set version reference stored in model metadata</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S08_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>AI Governance (MANAGE) — defines model card documentation requirements and approval workflow criteria</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S08_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Model serving infrastructure (BUILD L2.3.L3.3) — deploys models promoted to production in the registry</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S08">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_08_InputSuppliersProviders"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S08_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S08_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S08_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S08_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S09_SH1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#StakeholderItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Chief Data Officer / Head of ML Platform — accountable for model registry completeness and model governance compliance</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S09_SH2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#StakeholderItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>ML Platform Engineer / MLOps Engineer — operates and maintains the model registry platform and promotion workflow infrastructure</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S09_SH3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#StakeholderItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Data Scientists (RUN) — log model artefacts and metadata to the registry; initiate promotion requests with documentation</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S09_SH4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#StakeholderItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>AI Governance / Model Risk Management (MANAGE) — reviews model documentation and approves production promotion</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S09_SH5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#StakeholderItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Regulatory and Compliance (MANAGE) — uses model registry as evidence base for AI regulatory compliance and audit responses</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S09">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_09_Stakeholders"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S09_SH1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S09_SH2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S09_SH3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S09_SH4"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S09_SH5"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S10_A1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ActivityItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Operate the model registry: maintain platform availability, storage capacity, and version management for all registered model artefacts</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S10_A2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ActivityItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Enforce promotion workflow: configure stage gates with required approvals, documentation checks, and evaluation thresholds before promotion</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S10_A3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ActivityItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Maintain model metadata standards: define and enforce model card template; chase incomplete documentation before promotion is permitted</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S10_A4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ActivityItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Support model comparison: provide evaluation metric comparison views and lineage graphs enabling data scientists to select optimal versions</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S10_A5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ActivityItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Manage model lifecycle: archive superseded model versions on schedule; maintain minimum retention for regulatory purposes</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S10_A6">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ActivityItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Produce model governance reports: generate model inventory, deployment history, and model card completion status for AI governance reviews</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S10">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_10_Activities"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S10_A1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S10_A2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S10_A3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S10_A4"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S10_A5"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S10_A6"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S11_T1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ToolItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>MLflow Model Registry, Weights and Biases Registry, Comet ML, Neptune.ai — model artefact storage, versioning, and promotion workflow</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S11_T2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ToolItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>AWS SageMaker Model Registry, Google Vertex AI Model Registry, Azure ML Model Registry — managed model lifecycle within cloud ML platforms</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S11_T3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ToolItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Hugging Face Model Cards, Google Model Cards Toolkit — structured model documentation templates</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S11_T4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ToolItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>DVC (Data Version Control) — lightweight model and training data versioning for teams not using full MLOps platforms</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S11">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_11_Tools"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S11_T1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S11_T2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S11_T3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S11_T4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S12_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Model inventory — all production models with version, deployment target, training data reference, feature set version, and evaluation metrics</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S12_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Model cards — standardised documentation for each production model covering purpose, performance, limitations, fairness assessment, and training data</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S12_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Promotion workflow log — complete record of all promotion requests, reviewer decisions, and approval evidence for each model version</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S12_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Model deployment history — time-stamped record of all model version changes in each production environment</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S12">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_12_PrimaryDeliverables"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S12_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S12_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S12_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S12_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S13_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Model serving infrastructure (BUILD L2.3.L3.3) — consumes approved model artefacts from the registry for production deployment</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S13_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Data scientists (RUN) — use registry for model comparison, version management, and production deployment requests</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S13_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>AI Governance and Model Risk Management (MANAGE) — uses model cards and promotion logs as primary evidence for model governance reviews</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S13_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Regulatory and Legal — uses deployment history and model documentation for AI regulatory compliance and audit responses</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S13">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_13_OutcomesConsumers"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S13_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S13_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S13_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S13_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S14_K1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#KPIItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Registry coverage — percentage of production ML models with a registered, documented artefact in the model registry</dom:itemText>
    <dom:kpiTarget>100%</dom:kpiTarget>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S14_K2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#KPIItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Model card completeness — percentage of production models with fully completed model card (all mandatory fields populated)</dom:itemText>
    <dom:kpiTarget>100%</dom:kpiTarget>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S14_K3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#KPIItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Promotion workflow adherence — percentage of production model deployments executed through registry promotion workflow</dom:itemText>
    <dom:kpiTarget>100%</dom:kpiTarget>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S14_K4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#KPIItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Rollback capability — percentage of production models with a previous registered version enabling rollback within 1 hour</dom:itemText>
    <dom:kpiTarget>>95%</dom:kpiTarget>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S14_K5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#KPIItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Model governance audit readiness — percentage of AI regulatory audit questions answerable from model registry records without additional investigation</dom:itemText>
    <dom:kpiTarget>&gt;90%</dom:kpiTarget>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S14">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_14_KPIs"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S14_K1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S14_K2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S14_K3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S14_K4"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S14_K5"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S15_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>100% registry coverage is the only viable standard — models not in the registry are ungoverned; partial coverage creates an unmanageable shadow deployment estate</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S15_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Model cards must be complete before promotion — post-production documentation is never complete; the promotion gate is the only reliable enforcement point</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S15_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Promotion workflow must be mandatory, not advisory — manual deployments bypassing the registry undermine governance; CI/CD integration is the reliable solution</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S15_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Lineage from data to model is the AI governance requirement — model cards documenting the model but not training data provenance are incomplete for regulatory purposes</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S15">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_15_SuccessFactors"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_BUILD_L2.3_L3.4_S15_I1"/>
