  <!-- Specification: Advanced Analytics &amp; Data Science -->
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S01">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_01_Definition"/>
    <dom:sectionText>Advanced Analytics and Data Science is the capability to apply statistical analysis, machine learning, and computational modelling techniques to complex business problems that require insight beyond what standard reporting and descriptive analytics can provide. It covers the end-to-end data science workflow — from problem framing and feature engineering through model development, validation, deployment, and monitoring — and produces predictive models, segmentations, anomaly detections, and causal analyses that generate measurable business value through improved decisions and automated intelligence.</dom:sectionText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S02">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_02_BusinessContext"/>
    <dom:sectionText>Without advanced analytics capability, organisations operate at the descriptive analytics level — understanding what happened but not why, what will happen, or what should be done. Competitors with mature data science capabilities make systematically better predictions in pricing, demand, risk, and customer behaviour. The absence of data science capability creates compounding competitive disadvantage as the organisations that invest in advanced analytics generate proprietary intelligence advantages that widen over time.</dom:sectionText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S06">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_06_DataEconomics"/>
    <dom:sectionText>Data science investment is primarily in specialist talent (data scientists command significant salary premiums) and compute infrastructure. The economic return is highly variable by application — fraud model improvements can generate returns of 10-50x annual cost; demand forecasting improvements 3-10x; personalisation models 2-5x. Organisations should prioritise data science investment in domains where prediction accuracy has material financial impact and where data availability supports model development.</dom:sectionText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S03_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Predictive modelling — classification, regression, and survival analysis models predicting future outcomes or customer behaviours that drive proactive business decisions</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S03_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Segmentation and clustering — unsupervised learning techniques identifying natural groupings in customer, product, and transaction data for targeted interventions</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S03_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Causal analysis and experimentation — statistical methods distinguishing genuine causal relationships from correlations; experimental design for A/B and multivariate testing</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S03_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Anomaly detection — statistical and ML approaches identifying unusual patterns in time-series, transactional, and behavioural data for fraud, quality, and risk monitoring</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S03_I5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Model deployment and monitoring — production deployment of trained models with ongoing performance monitoring, drift detection, and retraining triggers</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S03">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_03_KeyAspects"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S03_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S03_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S03_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S03_I4"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S03_I5"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S04_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Predictive intelligence — business decisions informed by data-driven predictions rather than retrospective analysis and intuition</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S04_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Automated detection — fraud, anomalies, and quality issues identified automatically at scale rather than through manual review</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S04_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Quantified causal understanding — business investment decisions supported by causal evidence rather than correlation</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S04_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Competitive analytics advantage — proprietary data science models generating insights unavailable to competitors lacking equivalent data science capability</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S04">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_04_StrategicObjectives"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S04_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S04_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S04_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S04_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S05_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>GOVERN — AI Governance defines ethical standards, model risk requirements, and approval processes for advanced analytics models affecting customers</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S05_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>MANAGE — feature store (BUILD L2.3.L3.1 — via MANAGE) provides curated features for model development; model registry (BUILD L2.3.L3.4) governs model deployment</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S05_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>BUILD — ML platform (BUILD L2.3.L3.2) provides the training and serving infrastructure for advanced analytics models</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S05_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>RUN — advanced analytics models are the source of the most complex and high-value insights in the RUN layer; they feed BI reporting, data products, and operational applications with predictive intelligence</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S05">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_05_RelationshipToMacroProcesses"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S05_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S05_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S05_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S05_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S07_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>IN-SCOPE: All predictive modelling, segmentation, causal analysis, and anomaly detection work producing models or insights used in business decisions</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S07_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>IN-SCOPE: Experimental design, A/B testing, and causal inference for business initiative evaluation</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S07_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>IN-SCOPE: Model deployment, monitoring, and retraining lifecycle management for production analytics models</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S07_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>OUT-OF-SCOPE: LLM application development and generative AI applications (RUN L2.2.L3.3)</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S07_I5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>OUT-OF-SCOPE: ML infrastructure and platform operations (BUILD L2.3) — data science uses BUILD infrastructure but owns analytical model development</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S07">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_07_ScopeBoundaries"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S07_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S07_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S07_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S07_I4"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S07_I5"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S08_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Feature store (BUILD L2.3.L3.1) — curated, version-controlled ML features for model training and serving</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S08_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Training data from data warehouse and lake (BUILD L2.2) — historical data providing the foundation for model training</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S08_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Business domain experts — provide problem framing, feature domain knowledge, and model output validation</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S08_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>ML platform (BUILD L2.3.L3.2) — compute infrastructure, experiment tracking, and model deployment automation</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S08">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_08_InputSuppliersProviders"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S08_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S08_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S08_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S08_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S09_SH1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#StakeholderItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Chief Data Officer (CDO) — accountable for advanced analytics capability and its deployment in highest-value business domains</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S09_SH2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#StakeholderItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Data Scientist / Senior Data Scientist — develops, validates, and deploys predictive and analytical models; owns the scientific rigour of model development</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S09_SH3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#StakeholderItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Analytics Lead / Head of Data Science — directs data science portfolio prioritisation and ensures alignment with business value domains</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S09_SH4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#StakeholderItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Business Domain Partners (Marketing, Risk, Operations) — define analytical requirements, provide domain expertise, and consume model outputs</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S09_SH5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#StakeholderItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>AI Governance / Model Risk (MANAGE) — reviews and approves models affecting customer decisions for fairness, accuracy, and regulatory compliance</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S09">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_09_Stakeholders"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S09_SH1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S09_SH2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S09_SH3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S09_SH4"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S09_SH5"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S10_A1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ActivityItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Frame analytical problems: translate business questions into statistical problems with defined outcome variables, features, and success criteria</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S10_A2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ActivityItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Develop models: engineer features, select algorithms, train models, and conduct rigorous validation including out-of-time testing</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S10_A3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ActivityItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Deploy models to production: package model code, register in model registry, integrate with serving infrastructure, and monitor performance</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S10_A4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ActivityItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Monitor model performance: track prediction accuracy, feature drift, and outcome drift; trigger retraining when performance degrades below threshold</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S10_A5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ActivityItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Design and analyse experiments: create A/B test designs, power calculations, and causal inference analyses for business initiative evaluation</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S10_A6">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ActivityItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Communicate insights: translate technical analytical findings into business recommendations consumable by non-technical decision-makers</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S10">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_10_Activities"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S10_A1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S10_A2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S10_A3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S10_A4"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S10_A5"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S10_A6"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S11_T1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ToolItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Python data science stack (scikit-learn, XGBoost, LightGBM, statsmodels, PyTorch) — the primary model development and statistical analysis environment</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S11_T2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ToolItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>MLflow, Weights and Biases, Comet ML — experiment tracking and model registry for all analytical model development</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S11_T3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ToolItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Causal inference libraries (DoWhy, EconML, causalml) — causal analysis and experimental design support</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S11_T4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ToolItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Model monitoring (Evidently AI, WhyLabs, Arize AI) — production model performance tracking, drift detection, and retraining alerting</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S11">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_11_Tools"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S11_T1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S11_T2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S11_T3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S11_T4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S12_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Production model portfolio — all deployed predictive models with domain, methodology, accuracy history, training data reference, and monitoring status</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S12_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Analytical insight reports — data science findings presented as business recommendations with quantified impact and confidence</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S12_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Experiment results — A/B test and causal analysis results with statistical significance, effect size, and business recommendation</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S12_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Model performance monitoring dashboard — real-time accuracy, drift indicators, and retraining status for all production models</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S12">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_12_PrimaryDeliverables"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S12_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S12_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S12_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S12_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S13_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Business operations and decision systems — consume predictive model outputs for automated or assisted decisions in fraud, pricing, and customer management</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S13_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>BI Reporting (RUN L2.1.L3.1) — advanced analytics insights published as analytical reports for management consumption</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S13_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Data products (RUN L2.1.L3.3) — analytical model outputs packaged as data products for self-service consumption</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S13_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>AI Governance (MANAGE) — receives model documentation, evaluation evidence, and monitoring reports for model risk management</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S13">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_13_OutcomesConsumers"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S13_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S13_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S13_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S13_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S14_K1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#KPIItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Model deployment rate — percentage of developed models that reach production deployment within 90 days of approval</dom:itemText>
    <dom:kpiTarget>>60%</dom:kpiTarget>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S14_K2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#KPIItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Model accuracy attainment — percentage of production models meeting their defined minimum performance threshold at last evaluation</dom:itemText>
    <dom:kpiTarget>>85%</dom:kpiTarget>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S14_K3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#KPIItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Model retraining currency — percentage of production models retrained within defined retraining schedule or triggered by drift detection</dom:itemText>
    <dom:kpiTarget>>95%</dom:kpiTarget>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S14_K4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#KPIItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Business value attribution — quantified financial impact attributed to deployed data science models, tracked annually</dom:itemText>
    <dom:kpiTarget>Year-on-year growth &gt;20%</dom:kpiTarget>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S14_K5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#KPIItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Experiment velocity — number of A/B tests and causal analyses completed per quarter, as a proxy for analytical learning rate</dom:itemText>
    <dom:kpiTarget>Year-on-year growth &gt;15%</dom:kpiTarget>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S14">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_14_KPIs"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S14_K1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S14_K2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S14_K3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S14_K4"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S14_K5"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S15_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Problem framing before modelling — data scientists who start coding before defining the business problem clearly waste months building solutions to the wrong question</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S15_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Out-of-time validation is mandatory — models validated only on random held-out splits frequently fail in production due to temporal data leakage; out-of-time testing is the minimum standard</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S15_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Model monitoring enables learning — models that are not monitored cannot be improved; drift detection and accuracy tracking are as important as the initial model quality</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S15_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Business communication is a core data science skill — technically excellent models that cannot be explained to decision-makers will not be adopted or trusted</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S15">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_15_SuccessFactors"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S15_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S15_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S15_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.1_S15_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
