  <!-- Specification: Enterprise Search &amp; Information Retrieval -->
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S01">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_01_Definition"/>
    <dom:sectionText>Enterprise Search and Information Retrieval is the capability to provide employees and business systems with fast, accurate, and semantically rich search across the full enterprise information estate — including structured data, documents, emails, knowledge bases, and data products — through natural language queries and faceted navigation. It combines traditional keyword-based full-text search with modern semantic vector search and AI-powered answer synthesis to enable employees to find relevant information independently, regardless of where it is stored.</dom:sectionText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S02">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_02_BusinessContext"/>
    <dom:sectionText>Employees in large organisations spend an estimated 1.8 hours per day searching for information, with success rates below 50% for complex queries. Enterprise information is distributed across data catalogues, SharePoint, Confluence, emails, CRM, and dozens of other systems — none of which are searchable from a single interface. The business cost of failed information retrieval includes duplicated work, missed institutional knowledge, slow onboarding, and decisions made without access to relevant precedents or data.</dom:sectionText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S06">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_06_DataEconomics"/>
    <dom:sectionText>Enterprise search platform investment (Elasticsearch, OpenSearch, Vertex AI Search, Microsoft Azure AI Search) is moderate relative to the productivity value delivered. The primary cost is content integration engineering — connecting diverse enterprise content sources to the unified index. Organisations that quantify search productivity improvement consistently find ROI exceeds 5:1 within the first year, primarily through information retrieval time reduction.</dom:sectionText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S03_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Unified search index — federated index aggregating content from all enterprise information sources into a single, searchable corpus</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S03_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Semantic search — vector embedding-based search understanding query intent and conceptual relevance beyond keyword matching</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S03_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Personalised and role-aware results — search results filtered and ranked by the querying user's role, access permissions, and usage context</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S03_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>AI-powered answer synthesis — generative AI summarising and synthesising search results into direct answers with source attribution</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S03_I5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Search analytics — query logs, click-through rates, and zero-result tracking enabling continuous search quality improvement</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S03">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_03_KeyAspects"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S03_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S03_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S03_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S03_I4"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S03_I5"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S04_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Information finding speed — employees locate relevant information in minutes rather than hours across the enterprise information estate</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S04_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Knowledge democratisation — institutional knowledge captured in documents and data products accessible to all eligible employees rather than only those who know where to look</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S04_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Onboarding acceleration — new employees become productive faster with access to a searchable enterprise knowledge base</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S04_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Reduced information duplication — discoverable existing content reduces redundant document and analysis creation across the organisation</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S04">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_04_StrategicObjectives"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S04_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S04_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S04_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S04_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S05_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>GOVERN — Data Classification governs which information is searchable by which roles; Information Architecture defines the content taxonomy used in search facets</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S05_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>MANAGE — data catalogue (MANAGE.L2.3.L3.3) contributes data asset metadata to the enterprise search index; data products in RUN L2.1.L3.3 are discoverable through enterprise search</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S05_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>BUILD — vector database infrastructure (BUILD) hosts the semantic search embeddings; search index served through infrastructure maintained by BUILD platform engineering</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S05_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>RUN — enterprise search is the information retrieval foundation for LLM applications (L2.2.L3.3); RAG systems use the enterprise search index as their retrieval corpus</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S05">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_05_RelationshipToMacroProcesses"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S05_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S05_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S05_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S05_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S07_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>IN-SCOPE: All enterprise information sources designated for enterprise-wide search including documents, data catalogues, knowledge bases, and data products</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S07_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>IN-SCOPE: Search index management, semantic search capability, and AI-powered answer synthesis</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S07_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>IN-SCOPE: Search analytics and continuous quality improvement based on usage patterns</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S07_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>OUT-OF-SCOPE: Application-specific internal search within individual applications (HR portal, CRM internal search)</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S07_I5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>OUT-OF-SCOPE: External web search or competitor intelligence gathering (BUILD L2.1.L3.6)</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S07">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_07_ScopeBoundaries"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S07_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S07_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S07_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S07_I4"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S07_I5"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S08_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Enterprise content sources (SharePoint, Confluence, email, data catalogue, data products) — the diverse information stores federated into the enterprise search index</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S08_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>NLP models and embedding models (RUN L2.2.L3.2) — provide text embeddings and semantic understanding for vector search</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S08_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Access control framework (MANAGE.L2.2.L3.1) — role-based permissions determining which results each user can see</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S08_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Data product catalogue (RUN L2.1.L3.3) — data products contributed as searchable assets to the enterprise search index</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S08">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_08_InputSuppliersProviders"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S08_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S08_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S08_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S08_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S09_SH1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#StakeholderItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Chief Data Officer (CDO) — accountable for enterprise search capability as a core knowledge productivity infrastructure</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S09_SH2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#StakeholderItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Search Engineer / Knowledge Management Engineer — builds and maintains the search index, embedding pipeline, and answer synthesis layer</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S09_SH3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#StakeholderItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Content owners across business units — ensure their content is indexed, tagged, and maintained in a search-discoverable state</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S09_SH4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#StakeholderItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Employees (all eligible users) — primary search consumers; provide implicit feedback through click-through behaviour and explicit feedback through search ratings</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S09_SH5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#StakeholderItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Data Governance (MANAGE) — ensures search results respect data classification and access control policies</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S09">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_09_Stakeholders"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S09_SH1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S09_SH2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S09_SH3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S09_SH4"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S09_SH5"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S10_A1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ActivityItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Build and maintain the enterprise search index: configure content connectors for all designated information sources; manage ingestion schedules and re-index triggers</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S10_A2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ActivityItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Maintain semantic search capability: manage embedding model selection, vector database updates, and hybrid search ranking configurations</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S10_A3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ActivityItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Operate AI answer synthesis: configure and monitor the LLM-powered answer generation layer; evaluate answer quality and citation accuracy</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S10_A4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ActivityItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Enforce access control: ensure search results respect role-based permissions; audit access control compliance regularly</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S10_A5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ActivityItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Analyse search usage: track query patterns, zero-result queries, and click-through rates; use insights to improve search ranking and identify content gaps</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S10_A6">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ActivityItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Manage content quality: identify stale, duplicate, or low-quality content degrading search precision; work with content owners to improve index quality</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S10">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_10_Activities"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S10_A1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S10_A2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S10_A3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S10_A4"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S10_A5"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S10_A6"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S11_T1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ToolItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Search platforms (Elasticsearch, OpenSearch, Microsoft Azure AI Search, Google Vertex AI Search, Algolia) — core search index and ranking infrastructure</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S11_T2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ToolItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Vector databases (Pinecone, Weaviate, pgvector) — semantic search embedding storage and approximate nearest-neighbour retrieval</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S11_T3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ToolItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Content connectors (Microsoft Graph connectors, custom API connectors) — integration between enterprise content sources and the search index</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S11_T4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#ToolItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Search analytics (Kibana, custom dashboards on query logs) — search usage analysis, quality monitoring, and content gap identification</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S11">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_11_Tools"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S11_T1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S11_T2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S11_T3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S11_T4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S12_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Enterprise search index — unified, role-aware searchable index across all designated enterprise information sources</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S12_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Search quality report — query success rate, zero-result rate, click-through rate, and user satisfaction for the enterprise search service</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S12_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Content coverage map — inventory of enterprise information sources indexed versus not yet indexed with coverage roadmap</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S12_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Search analytics insights — top queries, content gaps, and search behaviour patterns informing content strategy and search improvement</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S12">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_12_PrimaryDeliverables"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S12_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S12_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S12_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S12_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S13_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>All enterprise employees (eligible users) — find information independently across the enterprise information estate through natural language queries</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S13_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>LLM applications (RUN L2.2.L3.3) — use enterprise search as the retrieval component of RAG architectures grounding LLM outputs in enterprise knowledge</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S13_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Data scientists and analysts (RUN) — discover relevant datasets, prior analyses, and domain documentation through enterprise search</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S13_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Onboarding teams (HR) — new employees use enterprise search to self-service access institutional knowledge and procedures</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S13">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_13_OutcomesConsumers"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S13_I1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S13_I2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S13_I3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S13_I4"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S14_K1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#KPIItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Search success rate — percentage of search sessions resulting in a click on a search result (proxy for query success)</dom:itemText>
    <dom:kpiTarget>&gt;60%</dom:kpiTarget>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S14_K2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#KPIItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Zero-result rate — percentage of queries returning no results (indicates index coverage gaps or query understanding issues)</dom:itemText>
    <dom:kpiTarget>&lt;10%</dom:kpiTarget>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S14_K3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#KPIItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Semantic search adoption — percentage of search queries resolved through semantic/vector search versus keyword-only search</dom:itemText>
    <dom:kpiTarget>&gt;50%</dom:kpiTarget>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S14_K4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#KPIItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Content source coverage — percentage of designated enterprise information sources with active search index integration</dom:itemText>
    <dom:kpiTarget>&gt;80%</dom:kpiTarget>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S14_K5">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#KPIItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Search satisfaction rating — percentage of users rating enterprise search as useful or above in quarterly survey</dom:itemText>
    <dom:kpiTarget>&gt;70%</dom:kpiTarget>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S14">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_14_KPIs"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S14_K1"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S14_K2"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S14_K3"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S14_K4"/>
    <dom:hasItem rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S14_K5"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S15_I1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Content freshness is the foundational search quality requirement — a search index containing stale or deleted content produces results that destroy user trust faster than no search at all</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S15_I2">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Access control must be enforced at query time, not at index time — role-based result filtering must apply to each query; indexing access controls alone is insufficient</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S15_I3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Zero-result analysis drives content strategy — queries that return no results are the most valuable signal for identifying enterprise knowledge gaps that need to be filled</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S15_I4">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionItem"/>
    <dom:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</dom:itemOrder>
    <dom:itemText>Hybrid search outperforms either approach alone — combining keyword and semantic search produces better precision than either alone; the optimal ranking blend is query-type specific</dom:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4_S15">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SectionContent"/>
    <dom:belongsToSpecification rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#SPEC_RUN_L2.2_L3.4"/>
    <dom:forSection rdf:resource="http://strategic-advisory.com/ontology/dom/2.0#Section_15_SuccessFactors"/>
